---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Partner Conversations - SkanPay"
  description="SkanPay helps payment apps, wallets, merchants, processors, and offer programs define their role in QR checkout."
  activePath="/partners/"
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Partners</p>
    <h1>Define the handoff before integration work begins</h1>
    <p>Partner review focuses on buyer approval, seller status, payment responsibility, and where redemption logic enters checkout.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="grid three">
      <article class="card route-card">
        <span>Payment app</span>
        <h3>Buyer approval surface</h3>
        <p>Show the buyer the seller, amount, and approval action in a trusted app experience.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card route-card">
        <span>Seller</span>
        <h3>Status and confirmation</h3>
        <p>Return a readable result so the seller knows whether to complete, retry, or cancel the sale.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card route-card">
        <span>Integration</span>
        <h3>Request boundary</h3>
        <p>Clarify request format, status handling, timeout behavior, and support responsibilities.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card route-card">
        <span>Offers</span>
        <h3>Redemption at checkout</h3>
        <p>Connect coupon, voucher, loyalty, or stored value without making it a separate checkout step.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card route-card">
        <span>Processor fit</span>
        <h3>Money movement stays explicit</h3>
        <p>Explore QR checkout without assuming merchants must abandon current processing relationships.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card route-card">
        <span>B2B2C</span>
        <h3>Shared acceptance path</h3>
        <p>Give brands, banks, wallets, and merchants a checkout experience buyers can recognize.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band">
    <div class="cta-band-inner">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Partner path</p>
        <h2>Review BeamCash before defining requirements.</h2>
        <p>The demo gives everyone the same visual reference for seller, buyer, and status responsibilities.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="button secondary" href="/beamcash-demo/">View BeamCash</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
